@baseUrl = http://localhost:9900

### Parse a complete natural-language spec (requires DashScope)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/spec/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "使用码长32、64、128和256，误码率从0到0.2，步长0.01，每组500帧，运行1000次蒙特卡洛实验"
}

### Parse an incomplete spec; expected NEEDS_CLARIFICATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/spec/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我做极化码实验"
}

### Upload theory knowledge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/knowledge/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WavePilotBoundary

--WavePilotBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

THEORY
--WavePilotBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="experimentType"

POLAR_CODE_K_IDENTIFICATION
--WavePilotBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

极化码码维数识别原理
--WavePilotBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

sample://polar-theory
--WavePilotBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="version"

v1
--WavePilotBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="polar-k-identification-theory.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./knowledge-samples/polar-k-identification-theory.md
--WavePilotBoundary--

### Filter knowledge by type and experiment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "不同码长下如何进行码维数识别实验",
  "topK": 5,
  "documentType": "EXPERIMENT_RECIPE",
  "experimentType": "POLAR_CODE_K_IDENTIFICATION"
}

### THEORY-only search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "极化码码维数识别的基础原理",
  "topK": 5,
  "documentType": "THEORY"
}

### POLAR_CODE_K_IDENTIFICATION-only search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "蒙特卡洛参数和实验失败原因",
  "topK": 5,
  "experimentType": "POLAR_CODE_K_IDENTIFICATION"
}

### ReactAgent chat (requires DashScope; current runner is Mock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-001",
  "message": "检索极化码实验模板，然后按码长32和64、误码率0到0.02、步长0.01、每组20帧、10次蒙特卡洛生成并提交实验"
}

### Chat SSE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wavepilot/chat/stream?sessionId=demo-001&message=查询刚才实验的状态
Accept: text/event-stream

### Phase 2 structured endpoint remains available
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "experimentType": "POLAR_CODE_K_IDENTIFICATION",
  "codeLengths": [32, 64],
  "errorRateStart": 0.0,
  "errorRateEnd": 0.02,
  "errorRateStep": 0.01,
  "sampleCount": 20,
  "monteCarloTimes": 10,
  "randomSeed": 20,
  "outputTypes": ["ACCURACY_CSV", "RUN_LOG"],
  "description": "Phase 2 regression example"
}

### Generate deterministic report (Job must be SUCCEEDED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{jobId}}/report

### Read generated JSON + Markdown report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{jobId}}/report

### Read Java-assembled report data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{jobId}}/report/data

### Revalidate all citations against source artifacts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{jobId}}/report/validate

### List citations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{jobId}}/citations

### Read one citation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/citations/{{citationId}}

### Artifact metadata (never returns an absolute local path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/metadata

### Verify artifact size and SHA-256
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/verify

### Download through the path-safe registry
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/download

### Start a replay of a SUCCEEDED job (creates an independent replay job)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{jobId}}/replay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "reproducibility check"
}

### List replays
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/replays

### Read one replay (status, replayJobId, failureReason)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/replays/{{replayId}}

### Read the structured comparison result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/replays/{{replayId}}/comparison

### Read the replay manifest (fingerprint, seed, template, algorithm axes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/replays/{{replayId}}/manifest

### Run the offline evaluation (default model stub-v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "datasetName": "default",
  "modelName": "stub-v1"
}

### List evaluation runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations

### Read one evaluation run (per-case results and metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}

### Read the evaluation report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/report

### Compare a baseline run with a candidate run on the same dataset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baselineEvaluationId": "EVAL-XXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "candidateEvaluationId": "EVAL-YYYYYYYYYYYY"
}

### Run a bounded Scientific Agent loop (Mock is the default runner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scientific-agent/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "search a bounded error-rate range that satisfies an accuracy threshold",
  "initialSpec": {
    "experimentType": "POLAR_CODE_K_IDENTIFICATION",
    "codeLengths": [32],
    "errorRateStart": 0.2,
    "errorRateEnd": 0.3,
    "errorRateStep": 0.05,
    "sampleCount": 20,
    "monteCarloTimes": 10,
    "randomSeed": 20,
    "outputTypes": ["ACCURACY_CSV", "RUN_LOG"],
    "description": "offline scientific-agent loop"
  },
  "metricName": "averageAccuracy",
  "operator": "GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUAL",
  "targetValue": 0.82,
  "parameterBounds": {
    "errorRateStart": {"minimum": 0.0, "maximum": 0.4, "maximumChangePerReplan": 0.1},
    "errorRateEnd": {"minimum": 0.05, "maximum": 0.5, "maximumChangePerReplan": 0.1}
  },
  "budget": {
    "maxIterations": 4,
    "maxExperiments": 4,
    "maxModelCalls": 0,
    "maxTokens": 0,
    "maxRetries": 1,
    "timeout": "PT2M"
  }
}

### Resume one Scientific Agent checkpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scientific-agent/runs/{{runId}}/resume

### Run Dense/BM25/Hybrid retrieval evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/retrieval-evaluations/run

### Read the human-readable retrieval report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/retrieval-evaluations/{{retrievalEvaluationId}}/report.md

### Evaluate actual AgentRun + retrieval eval + replay records
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent-regression-evaluations/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "runId": "RUN-XXXXXXXX-XXX",
  "retrievalEvaluationId": "RAGEVAL-XXXXXXXX-XXX",
  "replayId": "REPLAY-XXXXXXXX-XXX"
}
